This product includes design patterns and ideas inspired by open-source
Unity MCP projects. No full upstream monorepo is vendored; implementations
are original assemblies that follow similar Editor automation shapes.

Upstream references (not distributed as source copies in this repository):

- CoplayDev/unity-mcp (MIT) — https://github.com/CoplayDev/unity-mcp
- IvanMurzak/Unity-MCP (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/IvanMurzak/Unity-MCP
- CoderGamester/mcp-unity (MIT) — https://github.com/CoderGamester/mcp-unity

Phase V vision capture ports algorithms from Coplay ScreenshotUtility /
EditorWindowScreenshotUtility / manage_camera ImageContent patterns into
Unity-Comdr's own C# (see THIRD_PARTY.md borrow table). Upstream MIT license
terms continue to apply to those borrowed ideas.

Phase E agent UX borrows the Coplay RunTests/GetTestJob async job+poll
pattern (mode start returns job id; poll for results) into SampleSkills
tests_run / tests_status (see THIRD_PARTY.md).

Phase R live-bridge main-thread dispatch ports the Coplay
TransportCommandDispatcher queue+update-pump pattern and CoderGamester
update-drained bridge idea into LiveUnityBridgeServer (see THIRD_PARTY.md).

See THIRD_PARTY.md for details.
